                                            <span>Sai sá»‘ vá»‹ trĂ­ Ä‘o Ä‘Æ°á»£c: {listing.distanceDeviationMeters.toFixed(2)} mĂ©t</span>
                                            {listing.riskFlag && <span className="ml-auto text-xs bg-red-600 text-white px-2 py-1 rounded">Rá»¦I RO TIN áº¢O CAO</span>}
                                        </div>
                                    ) : (
